# 1. Purpose

The purpose of this Stakeholder Register is to identify, classify and document individuals and stakeholder groups who have an interest in, influence over, or are affected by the HR360 project.

The register supports stakeholder analysis, communication planning, requirements elicitation, decision-making and stakeholder engagement throughout the project lifecycle.

The register will be reviewed and updated when new stakeholders are identified or when stakeholder responsibilities change.

---

# 2. Stakeholder Identification Approach

Stakeholders have been identified across the following categories:

* Project governance
* Business ownership
* HR operations
* Operations
* Finance
* Recruitment
* Management
* End users
* Technical delivery

Stakeholders are classified according to their expected level of influence and impact on the project.

